          "@type": "Question",
          "name": "What's the difference between laser cutting and mechanical punching for facade panels?",
          "acceptedAnswer": {
            "@type": "Answer",
            "text": "Laser cutting handles intricate, custom, or highly detailed patterns with real precision, while mechanical punching is faster and more economical for simple, repeating perforation patterns fabricated at scale."
