          "@type": "Question",
          "name": "Which finish lasts longest on a facade panel?",
          "acceptedAnswer": {
            "@type": "Answer",
            "text": "PVDF coating generally offers the strongest resistance to UV fading and weathering, followed by anodising, with standard powder coating being the most economical but least weather stable of the three options."
