          "@type": "Question",
          "name": "How can I tell if a facade manufacturer has genuine quality control?",
          "acceptedAnswer": {
            "@type": "Answer",
            "text": "Ask whether they document checks at each production stage, material verification, dimensional tolerance, and finish testing, rather than relying only on a quick final visual inspection before dispatch."
          }
